WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.391
Cat hissed again.

2
00:00:08.392 --> 00:00:11.740
Tom tapped his pocket to make her stop.

3
00:00:11.741 --> 00:00:16.041
Dirk frowned at Tom.

4
00:00:16.042 --> 00:00:21.620
The queen blew her nose with a honk!

5
00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:28.023
"I want a special dog for Prince Eric," she said.

6
00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:30.447
"See what you can do, Tom."

7
00:00:30.448 --> 00:00:34.761
Tom gulped. "I'll try, Your—"

8
00:00:34.762 --> 00:00:39.297
Dirk stepped forward with an evil smile.

9
00:00:39.298 --> 00:00:43.828
"Tom will start working at once, Your Majesty!

10
00:00:43.829 --> 00:00:46.718
Right, Tom?"

11
00:00:46.719 --> 00:01:01.048
"Right!" Tom said nervously.

12
00:01:01.049 --> 00:01:05.561
Outside the Throne Room, Dirk glared at Tom.

13
00:01:05.562 --> 00:01:12.169
"I know that cat is in your pocket," he said.

14
00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:16.041
Tom froze as Dirk leaned in close.

15
00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:20.746
"Keep that cat away from the queen," Dirk growled.

16
00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:24.397
"And if you fail at this birthday task . . .

17
00:01:24.398 --> 00:01:31.992
You'll be thrown in the Grim Dungeon!"

18
00:01:31.993 --> 00:01:41.993
Tom shivered and rushed off to his lab.

19
00:01:41.994 --> 00:01:46.139
"What am I going to do, Cat?" he asked.

20
00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:49.885
Cat licked her paws.

21
00:01:49.886 --> 00:01:52.819
"You need to find a dog spell.

22
00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:55.299
But I don't like dogs.

23
00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:58.990
They chase cats."

24
00:01:58.991 --> 00:02:04.518
"Maybe I can make a nice dog appear," Tom said.

25
00:02:04.519 --> 00:02:08.598
He lifted his wand. Poof!

26
00:02:08.599 --> 00:02:11.387
"Oops," Tom said.

27
00:02:11.388 --> 00:02:13.530
It wasn't a dog.

28
00:02:13.531 --> 00:02:18.311
It was a hog!

29
00:02:18.312 --> 00:02:34.195
The hog squealed and ran off.

30
00:02:34.196 --> 00:02:39.331
Tom tried another spell. Poof!

31
00:02:39.332 --> 00:02:43.057
"Oops," said Tom.

32
00:02:43.058 --> 00:02:49.532
"Ribbit!" said a big green frog.

